<title>SWITZERLAND: Georg Fischer H1 1996 group net falls.</title>
<headline>Georg Fischer H1 1996 group net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAFFHAUSEN, Switzerland 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>			  (million SFR unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p> Group net				 20		 vs 35</p>
<p> Group orders received		 1,260	    vs 1,232</p>
<p> Group sales			     1,162	    vs 1,120</p>
<p>Note - Full name of Swiss engineering group is Georg Fischer AG. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
